  - m_Id: 26524700727
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700728
    m_Localized: Accelerates your spellcasting for {0} sec, granting {1}% haste,
      {2}% critical damage bonus and preventing damage from delaying your spellcasts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700729
    m_Localized: Icy Veins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700730
    m_Localized: 'Stuns the target for {0} sec and causes the target to be considered
      Frozen for the duration of its stun.


      Only usable on Frozen targets
      or while caster is affected by Fingers of Frost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700731
    m_Localized: Deep Freeze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700732
    m_Localized: "Infuses the target with brilliance, increasing their Intellect
      by {0}% for {1} seconds.  \r\n\r\nIf target is in your party or raid, all party
      and raid members will be affected."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700733
    m_Localized: Arcane Intellect
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700734
    m_Localized: 'Suppresses movement slowing effects and increases your movement
      speed by {0}% for {1} sec.


      Castable while another spell is in progress
      and unaffected by global cooldown.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700735
    m_Localized: Blazing Speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26524700736
    m_Localized: 'Teleports you forward {0} yds or until reaching an obstacle, and
      frees you from all stuns and bonds.


      Usable while stunned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894976
    m_Localized: Blink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894977
    m_Localized: 'Targets in a cone in front of you take ({0}% of Spell power) Frost
      damage and have movement slowed by {1}% for {2} sec.


      Has {3:P0} chance
      to trigger Fingers of Frost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894978
    m_Localized: Cone of Cold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894979
    m_Localized: 'Counters the enemy''s spellcast, preventing any spell from that
      school of magic from being cast for {0} sec.


      Castable while another
      spell is in progress and unaffected by global cooldown.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894980
    m_Localized: Counterspell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894981
    m_Localized: "Blasts the enemy for ({0}% of Spell power) Fire damage. \n\nAlways
      deals a critical strike and causes Hot Streak to trigger unless target is immune
      to critical strikes.\n\nCastable while another spell is in progress and unaffected
      by global cooldown."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894982
    m_Localized: Fire Blast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894983
    m_Localized: "\rCalls down a pillar of fire, burning all enemies within the area
      for ({0}% of Spell power) Fire damage and an additional ({1}% of Spell power)
      Fire damage every {2} sec for {3} sec."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894984
    m_Localized: Flame Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894985
    m_Localized: A fast spell that heals an ally for ({0}% of Spell power).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894986
    m_Localized: Flash Heal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894987
    m_Localized: 'Launches a bolt of frost at the enemy, causing ({0}% of Spell power)
      Frost damage and slowing movement speed by {1}% for {2} sec.


      Has {3:P0}
      chance to trigger Fingers of Frost.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894988
    m_Localized: Frost Bolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894989
    m_Localized: 'Blasts enemies within {0} yds of you for ({1}% of Spell power)
      Frost damage and freezes them in place for {2} sec.


      Damage may interrupt
      the freeze effect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894990
    m_Localized: Frost Nova
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894991
    m_Localized: Perform a miracle, healing an ally for ({0}% of Spell power).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894992
    m_Localized: 'Holy Word: Serenity'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894993
    m_Localized: Removes all movement impairing effects and all effects which cause
      loss of control of your character while in PvP combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894994
    m_Localized: Honorable Medallion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894995
    m_Localized: 'Shields you with ice, absorbing ({0}% of total health) damage.
      Lasts {1} sec.


      While the shield holds, spells will not be interrupted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894996
    m_Localized: Ice Barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894997
    m_Localized: "\rEncases you in a block of ice, protecting you from all attacks
      and damage for {0} sec, but during that time you cannot attack, move, or cast
      spells.  "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894998
    m_Localized: Ice Block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528894999
    m_Localized: "Quickly fling a shard of ice at the target, dealing ({0}% of Spell
      power) Frost damage\r.\n\r\nIce Lance damage is quadrupled against frozen targets.
      Targets also confidered being frozen if caster is affected by Fingers of Frost.\n\nDamage
      is increased by {1}% when consuming Fingers of Frost charge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895000
    m_Localized: Ice Lance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895001
    m_Localized: 'Causes a whirl of icy wind around the enemy, dealing ({0}% of Spell
      power) Frost damage to the target and to all other enemies within {1} yards,
      and freezing them in place for {2} sec.


      Damage may interrupt the freeze
      effect.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895002
    m_Localized: Ice Nova
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895003
    m_Localized: 'Instantly kills current target.


      Temporary debug spell,
      only usable against creatures.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895004
    m_Localized: Kill Creature
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895005
    m_Localized: 'Instantly kills caster.


      Temporary debug spell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895006
    m_Localized: Kill Self
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895007
    m_Localized: 'The target becomes a Living Bomb, taking ({0}% of Spell power)
      Fire damage every {4} sec for {1} sec, and then exploding to deal an additional
      ({2}% of Spell power) Fire damage to the target and all other enemies within
      {3} yards.


      When applied first time instantly deals single tick damage.
      Explosion timer is reset with duration on refresh.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895008
    m_Localized: Living Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895009
    m_Localized: 'Reduces all damage taken by a friendly target by {0}% for {1} sec.


      Castable
      while stunned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895010
    m_Localized: Pain Suppression
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895011
    m_Localized: "\rTransforms the enemy into a sheep, wandering around incapacitated
      for {0} sec. While affected, the victim cannot take actions.\n\nDamage will
      cancel the effect."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895012
    m_Localized: Polymorph
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895013
    m_Localized: When activated, your next Mage spell with a casting time less than
      10 sec becomes an instant cast spell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895014
    m_Localized: Presence of Mind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895015
    m_Localized: 'Hurls an immense fiery boulder that causes ({0}% of Spell power)
      Fire damage and additional ({1}% of Spell power) every {2} sec for {3} sec
      after.


      Getting two direct-damage critical strikes with Fire Blast or
      Scorch in a row will make your next Pyroblast instant cast.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895016
    m_Localized: Pyroblast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895017
    m_Localized: Fill the target with faith in the light, healing them instantly
      for ({0}% of Spell power) and then ({1}% of Spell power) every {2} sec for
      {3} sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895018
    m_Localized: Renew
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895019
    m_Localized: 'Caster resurrects with 50% health.


      Only usable while dead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895020
    m_Localized: Resurrect Self
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895021
    m_Localized: "\rScorches an enemy for ({0}% of Spell power) Fire damage.\n\nCastable
      while moving.\n\nMay trigger Hot Streak after getting 2 critical strikes in
      a row."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895022
    m_Localized: Scorch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895023
    m_Localized: '{0} yd range'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895024
    m_Localized: '{0} sec cooldown'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895025
    m_Localized: Instant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895026
    m_Localized: '{0} sec cast'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895027
    m_Localized: General
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895028
    m_Localized: Spell is Not Known
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895029
    m_Localized: 'Shapeshift into Cat Form increasing movement speed by {0}%, granting
      protection from Polymorph effects, and reducing falling damage.



      The
      act of shapeshifting frees you from movement impairing effects.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895030
    m_Localized: Cat Form
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895031
    m_Localized: Druid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895032
    m_Localized: Mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895033
    m_Localized: 'Rake the target for ({0}% of Attack power) Bleed damage and an
      additional ({1}% of Attack power) Bleed damage every {2} sec over {3} sec.


      Reduces
      the target''s movement speed by {4}%


      Awards 1 combo point.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895034
    m_Localized: Rake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895035
    m_Localized: 'Shred the target, causing ({0}% of Attack power + 20) Physical
      damage to the target.


      Deals 50% increased damage against bleeding targets.


      Awards
      2 combo points.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895036
    m_Localized: Shred
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895037
    m_Localized: 'Swipe nearby enemies, inflicting ({0}% of Attack power) Physical
      damage.


      Deals 33% increased damage against bleeding targets



      Awards
      1 combo point.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895038
    m_Localized: Swipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895039
    m_Localized: No Combo Points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895040
    m_Localized: "Finishing move that causes damage per combo point and consumes
      up to 25 additional Energy to increase damage by up to 100%.\r\n\r\nWhen used
      on targets below 25% health, Ferocious Bite will also refresh the duration
      of your Rip on your target\r\n\r\nCritical strike chance doubled against bleeding
      targets.\r\n\r\n  1 point  : [({0}% of Attack power) * 1] damage\r\n  2 points:
      [({0}% of Attack power) * 2] damage\r\n  3 points: [({0}% of Attack power)
      * 3] damage\r\n  4 points: [({0}% of Attack power) * 4] damage\r\n  5 points:
      [({0}% of Attack power) * 5] damage"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26528895041
    m_Localized: Ferocious Bite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089280
    m_Localized: "Finishing move that causes Bleed damage over time every {1} sec.
      Lasts longer per combo point.\r\n\r\n  1 point  : ({0}% of Attack power) for
      8 sec\r\n  2 points: ({0}% of Attack power) for 12 sec\r\n  3 points: ({0}%
      of Attack power) for 16 sec\r\n  4 points: ({0}% of Attack power) for 20 sec\r\n 
      5 points: ({0}% of Attack power) for 24 sec"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089281
    m_Localized: Rip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089282
    m_Localized: Reduces all damage you take by {0}% for {1} sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089283
    m_Localized: Survival Instincts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089284
    m_Localized: Not Enough Energy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089285
    m_Localized: Not Enough Health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089286
    m_Localized: Not Enough Mana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089287
    m_Localized: Not Enough Rage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089288
    m_Localized: 'Increases movement speed by {0}% for {1} sec.


      Does not
      break prowling.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089289
    m_Localized: Dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089290
    m_Localized: Instantly restores {0} Energy, and increases the damage of all your
      attacks by {1}% for their full duration. Lasts {2} sec.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089291
    m_Localized: Tiger's Fury
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089292
    m_Localized: 'Mangle the target for ({0}% of Attack power) Physical damage.



      Deals
      20% additional damage against bleeding targets



      Generates {1} Energy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089293
    m_Localized: Mangle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089294
    m_Localized: "Finishing move that causes Physical damage and stuns the target.
      Damage and duration increased per combo point:\r\n\r\n  1 point  : {0}%*1 Attack
      power damage, 1 sec\r\n  2 points: {0}%*2 Attack power damage, 2 sec\r\n  3
      points: {0}%*3 Attack power damage, 3 sec\r\n  4 points: {0}%*4 Attack power
      damage, 4 sec\r\n  5 points: {0}%*5 Attack power damage, 5 sec"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089295
    m_Localized: Maim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089296
    m_Localized: 1 to 5 Combo Points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26533089297
    m_Localized: '{0} Energy'
